*HEADING
** ============================================================================
** ABAQUS ACOUSTIC TRANSMISSION LOSS SIMULATION
** Stratified Ocean Medium - 2D Waveguide with Thermocline Layers
** ============================================================================
** Units: SI (m, kg, s, Pa)
** Frequency range: 100 - 5000 Hz
** Domain: 100m x 50m (length x depth)
** Mesh: 40 x 20 elements (2.5m spacing - coarse for fast demo)
** Three-layer stratification: surface/thermocline/deep ocean
** ============================================================================
**
** ============================================================================
** NODE GENERATION (41 x 21 nodes = 861 nodes)
** ============================================================================
*NODE
** Generate first row (z=0, x=0 to 100m in 2.5m steps)
1, 0.0, 0.0
*NGEN, NSET=ROW1
1, 41, 1, 2.5, 0.0, 0.0
** Generate all rows (z=0 to 50m in 2.5m steps)
*NFILL, NSET=ALLNODES
ROW1, ROW1, 20, 41, 0.0, 2.5, 0.0
**
** ============================================================================
** ELEMENT GENERATION (40 x 20 = 800 elements)
** ============================================================================
*ELEMENT, TYPE=AC2D4
** Generate first row of elements
1, 1, 2, 43, 42
*ELGEN, ELSET=ALL_ELEMENTS
1, 40, 1, 1, 20, 41, 41
**
** ============================================================================
** ELEMENT SETS FOR LAYERS
** ============================================================================
** Layer 1: Surface (z = 0-15m = rows 1-6, elements 1-240)
*ELSET, ELSET=LAYER1, GENERATE
1, 240, 1
** Layer 2: Thermocline (z = 15-35m = rows 7-14, elements 241-560)  
*ELSET, ELSET=LAYER2, GENERATE
241, 560, 1
** Layer 3: Deep (z = 35-50m = rows 15-20, elements 561-800)
*ELSET, ELSET=LAYER3, GENERATE
561, 800, 1
**
** ============================================================================
** NODE SETS FOR BOUNDARIES AND PROBES
** ============================================================================
** Inlet face (x=0, all z)
*NSET, NSET=INLET_NODES, GENERATE
1, 821, 41
** Outlet face (x=100m, all z)
*NSET, NSET=OUTLET_NODES, GENERATE  
41, 861, 41
** Bottom face (z=0, all x)
*NSET, NSET=BOTTOM_NODES, GENERATE
1, 41, 1
** Top face (z=50m, all x)
*NSET, NSET=TOP_NODES, GENERATE
821, 861, 1
** Probe IN: x=20m (column 9, i=9: nodes 9, 50, 91, ...)
*NSET, NSET=PROBE_IN, GENERATE
9, 829, 41
** Probe OUT: x=80m (column 33, i=33: nodes 33, 74, 115, ...)
*NSET, NSET=PROBE_OUT, GENERATE  
33, 853, 41
**
** ============================================================================
** SURFACES FOR BOUNDARY CONDITIONS
** ============================================================================
** Inlet surface (left face, S4)
*SURFACE, NAME=INLET_SURF, TYPE=ELEMENT
LAYER1, S4
LAYER2, S4
LAYER3, S4
** Outlet surface (right face, S2)
*SURFACE, NAME=OUTLET_SURF, TYPE=ELEMENT
LAYER1, S2
LAYER2, S2
LAYER3, S2
** Top surface (S1)
*SURFACE, NAME=TOP_SURF, TYPE=ELEMENT
LAYER1, S1
** Bottom surface (S3)
*SURFACE, NAME=BOTTOM_SURF, TYPE=ELEMENT
LAYER3, S3
**
** ============================================================================
** MATERIAL DEFINITIONS - THREE-LAYER STRATIFICATION
** ============================================================================
**
** LAYER 1: Surface water (warm, less dense)
** Temperature: ~20°C, Salinity: 35 ppt
** Sound speed: c1 = 1520 m/s
** Density: ρ1 = 1023 kg/m³
** Bulk modulus: K1 = ρ1 * c1² = 1023 * 1520² = 2.364e9 Pa
**
*MATERIAL, NAME=WATER_SURFACE
*DENSITY
1023.0,
*BULK MODULUS
2.364e9,
**
** LAYER 2: Thermocline (strong gradient)
** Temperature: ~10°C, Salinity: 35 ppt  
** Sound speed: c2 = 1490 m/s
** Density: ρ2 = 1026 kg/m³
** Bulk modulus: K2 = ρ2 * c2² = 1026 * 1490² = 2.278e9 Pa
**
*MATERIAL, NAME=WATER_THERMOCLINE
*DENSITY
1026.0,
*BULK MODULUS
2.278e9,
**
** LAYER 3: Deep water (cold, dense)
** Temperature: ~4°C, Salinity: 35 ppt
** Sound speed: c3 = 1470 m/s
** Density: ρ3 = 1028 kg/m³  
** Bulk modulus: K3 = ρ3 * c3² = 1028 * 1470² = 2.221e9 Pa
**
*MATERIAL, NAME=WATER_DEEP
*DENSITY
1028.0,
*BULK MODULUS
2.221e9,
**
** ============================================================================
** SECTION ASSIGNMENTS
** ============================================================================
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=LAYER1, MATERIAL=WATER_SURFACE
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=LAYER2, MATERIAL=WATER_THERMOCLINE
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=LAYER3, MATERIAL=WATER_DEEP
**
** ============================================================================
** STEADY-STATE DYNAMICS STEP
** ============================================================================
*STEP, NAME=ACOUSTIC_SWEEP, NLGEOM=NO, PERTURBATION
*STEADY STATE DYNAMICS, DIRECT
** Frequency sweep: 100 to 5000 Hz in 50 Hz steps (99 points for faster demo)
100., 5000., 98
**
** ============================================================================
** INCIDENT WAVE INTERACTION (Plane wave excitation)
** ============================================================================
** Define incident wave fluid properties (use surface layer properties)
*INCIDENT WAVE INTERACTION PROPERTY, NAME=PLANE_WAVE_PROP
*INCIDENT WAVE FLUID PROPERTY
** Density, Sound speed
1023.0, 1520.0
**
** Apply incident wave at inlet (direction: +x = [1, 0])
*INCIDENT WAVE INTERACTION, NAME=SOURCE, PROPERTY=PLANE_WAVE_PROP
INLET_SURF, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0
**
** ============================================================================
** NON-REFLECTING BOUNDARY CONDITIONS (Impedance BC)
** ============================================================================
** Outlet: non-reflecting (radiating boundary)
*IMPEDANCE, TYPE=NONREFLECTING
OUTLET_SURF,
**
** Top and bottom surfaces: non-reflecting
*IMPEDANCE, TYPE=NONREFLECTING  
TOP_SURF,
BOTTOM_SURF,
**
** ============================================================================
** OUTPUT REQUESTS
** ============================================================================
** Field output: Pressure (complex) at selected frequencies
*OUTPUT, FIELD, FREQUENCY=10
*NODE OUTPUT
POR,
**
** History output: Pressure at probe locations (all frequencies)
*OUTPUT, HISTORY, FREQUENCY=1
** Probe IN (x=20m)
*NODE OUTPUT, NSET=PROBE_IN
POR,
** Probe OUT (x=80m)  
*NODE OUTPUT, NSET=PROBE_OUT
POR,
**
*END STEP
